    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"AsyncHandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#toCompletableFuture(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">AsyncHandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"AsyncHandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#toCompletableFuture(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">AsyncHandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method return type</a> is\nsupported by this handler.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法返回类型</a>是否由该处理器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> this method will only be invoked after\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>\nis called and it returns <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 此方法仅在调用<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>并返回<code>true</code>后才会被调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return value handling will then continue when\nthe CompletableFuture is completed with either success or error.",
      "translation": "返回值的处理将在 CompletableFuture 以成功或错误完成时继续。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Support for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletableFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletableFuture</code></a> (and as of 4.3.7 also <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletionStage.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletionStage</code></a>)\nas a return value type.",
      "translation": "支持将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletableFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletableFuture</code></a>`（以及自 4.3.7 版本起也包括 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletionStage.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletionStage</code></a>`）作为返回值类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Adapt the asynchronous return value to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletableFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletableFuture</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将异步返回值适配为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/CompletableFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>CompletableFuture</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this handler supports the supplied return type;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此处理器支持提供的返回类型；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the method return type to check",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 要检查的方法返回类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnValue</code> - the value returned from the handler method",
      "translation": "<code>returnValue</code> - 从处理程序方法返回的值",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the type of the return value",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 返回值的类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resulting CompletableFuture, or <code>null</code> in which case\nno further handling will be performed",
      "translation": "生成的 `CompletableFuture`，或为 `<code>null</code>`（此时将不再执行进一步的处理）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
